WEBVTT

00:01:58.672 --> 00:02:00.666
really trying to make it to high school.

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:04.169
Well, trying to stay out of trouble was a little unavoidable.

00:02:04.169 --> 00:02:05.883
You had to survive.

00:02:05.883 --> 00:02:08.536
You just had to do things sometimes.

00:02:08.536 --> 00:02:10.889
So there were a lot of teachers who were like,

00:02:10.889 --> 00:02:12.315
"She's never going to make it.

00:02:12.315 --> 00:02:13.906
She has an issue with authority.

00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:15.549
She's not going to go anywhere."

00:02:15.549 --> 00:02:19.642
Some teachers completely wrote me off as a lost cause.

00:02:19.642 --> 00:02:22.809
But then, they were very surprised

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:26.000
when I graduated from high school.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.862
I was accepted to Pepperdine University,

00:02:28.862 --> 00:02:31.985
and I came back to the same school that I attended